WEBVTT

00:22:29.171 --> 00:22:31.386
for the Hasso Plattner Founders' Award,

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:33.701
the most important
recognition for innovation

00:22:33.725 --> 00:22:35.619
an employee can receive at SAP.

00:22:36.320 --> 00:22:38.686
After multiple rounds
of interviews and voting,

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:41.216
Nico was selected as a finalist.

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:42.988
He was invited to the award ceremony

00:22:43.012 --> 00:22:44.336
in Germany.

00:22:44.360 --> 00:22:47.386
Ceremony announcer:
The winner is Nicholas Neumann,

00:22:47.410 --> 00:22:49.363
Posting Automation.

00:22:49.387 --> 00:22:50.653
(Applause)

00:22:51.452 --> 00:22:55.856
NN: And you have, I think,
100,000 employees watching the event.

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:57.906
You can imagine how it feels.

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:00.604
It's overwhelming to have
so many people watching it,